      "level": "warn",
      "id": "license-drift",
      "lines": [
        "Licence agpl (appinfo/info.xml, composer.json), AGPL-3.0-or-later (package.json), LICENSES/ holds AGPL-3.0-only.txt, AGPL-3.0-or-later.txt, Apache-2.0.txt, BSD-3-Clause.txt, CC0-1.0.txt, GPL-3.0-or-later.txt, ISC.txt, MIT.txt, MPL-2.0.txt.",
        "  agpl in appinfo/info.xml is a deprecated App Store value, shown there as AGPLv3+, which is AGPL-3.0-or-later. With min-version 35 info.xml can state an SPDX id instead.",
        "  No SPDX id: agpl (composer.json). Only an SPDX id says which licence is meant, and for a GNU licence whether -only or -or-later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "node-version",
      "lines": [
        "Node stated as ^24.0.0 (package.json engines.node).",
        "  Not stated in .nvmrc, so nothing keeps the other places from drifting away from it.",
        "  The workflows read node-version from a variable, which is not resolved here, so whether CI builds on that major is not decidable from the checkout."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "tooling",
      "lines": [
        "Tooling in the checkout: ESLint (.eslintrc.js, superseded form), Stylelint (stylelint.config.js), Psalm (psalm.xml), PHP-CS-Fixer (.php-cs-fixer.dist.php), REUSE (REUSE.toml).",
        " ESLint is configured in .eslintrc.js: ESLint 9 reads the flat config only; the eslintrc form, an .eslintrc file or the eslintConfig key in package.json, is ignored unless the run is pinned to ESLint 8.",
        " No PHPUnit configuration: there is no test harness in the checkout, so nothing can be run against a change.",
        " No EditorConfig configuration: indentation is whatever each contributor's editor does."
      ]
    },
